Use io.
Define local values as array<whole number, 9>.
Set item 0 of values to 11.
Set item 1 of values to 12.
Set item 2 of values to 13.
Set item 3 of values to 14.
Set item 4 of values to 15.
Set item 5 of values to 16.
Set item 6 of values to 17.
Set item 7 of values to 18.
Set item 8 of values to 19.
Let checks be 0.
If every x in values is more than 0, add 1 to checks.
If some x in values is more than 18, add 2 to checks.
If no x in values is less than 0, add 4 to checks.
Say checks.
Give back 0.
